OL,3,AXbox bets on Gears of War in battle of
OL,4,Agaming giants
OL,5,
OL,6,FGears of War, one of the video games
OL,7,Fthat helped Microsoft's Xbox to win
OL,8,Fover millions of fans, is back.
OL,10,FPrequel E-Day takes players back to
OL,11,Fwhere it all started, telling the
OL,12,Forigin story of humanity's conflict
OL,13,Fwith The Locust - the series'
OL,14,Fhorrifying enemy species.
OL,16,FThe game's been well-received by
OL,17,Fcritics and players, but it's also seen
OL,18,Fas a big test of Xbox's new direction.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
