OL,5,
OL,6,FUnlike recent flagship titles from the
OL,7,Fcompany's studios, which have been
OL,8,Freleased on PlayStation 5 and, in some
OL,9,Fcases, Nintendo Switch, E-Day is being
OL,10,Fpushed as an Xbox exclusive.
